If there is an opioid-dosage-recommendation and there is an opioid-initiation then the opioid-dosage-recommendation applies during the opioid-initiation.
If there is an opioid-dosage-recommendation and there is a dosage-increase then the opioid-dosage-recommendation applies during the dosage-increase.
A dosage-reduction has a different-benefit.
A dosage-reduction has a different-risk.
